{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to go fight in space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Man 2 answers the questions, &quot;What would it be like if I went to go fight in outer space? What would I fight? Who would I meet? What lies beyond the distant limits of the human perception of our own existence? What if I couldn't die?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The casual gameplay of an arcade space-shooter meets the rogue-like element of random boons that reward adaptive playstyles. Spam the spacebar to deal damage as fast as you can, learn the best way to utilize the gifts that random NPCs give you, how to obtain potions that allow you to activate your accumulating powers and when to use them, all to a killer, entrancing soundtrack composed and produced by Placeless. The skilled will be tested, the curious will be rewarded, and you can't die.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Placeless.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds by Zapsplat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font engine by Scribble.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613940?t=1753682290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613940/cc54e123069aaac34a6ea4b621cf34b573d182d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753682290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613940/7d6f87306fb0624fd003f73ba4e621c6484e9c79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753682290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613940/7d6f87306fb0624fd003f73ba4e621c6484e9c79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753682290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some characters wear mildly revealing outfits and use some PG-13 language. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to go fight in space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Man 2 answers the questions, &quot;What would it be like if I went to go fight in outer space? What would I fight? Who would I meet? What lies beyond the distant limits of the human perception of our own existence? What if I couldn't die?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The casual gameplay of an arcade space-shooter meets the rogue-like element of random boons that reward adaptive playstyles. Spam the spacebar to deal damage as fast as you can, learn the best way to utilize the gifts that random NPCs give you, how to obtain potions that allow you to activate your accumulating powers and when to use them, all to a killer, entrancing soundtrack composed and produced by Placeless. The skilled will be tested, the curious will be rewarded, and you can't die.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Placeless.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds by Zapsplat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font engine by Scribble.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Pumpkn Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613940/9110f3373816935e1a7b38066b34111ee064116c/header.jpg?t=1753682290","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Music provided by Placeless. <br />\r\nSound effects provided by Zapsplat. <br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3613940/821496691/ee6d19971807a84988391e1f9520d3f60fdcba8b/1753675276/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753682289","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3613940/821496691/ee6d19971807a84988391e1f9520d3f60fdcba8b/1753675276/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753682289","highlight":true,"hls_h26